<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=207" title="View the profile of Uuldiin">Uuldiin</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 163<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.strike9.com/file.ashx?path=%2fuuldiin21%2ffullsize%2fa02kasumi50.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Fuck You<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=207"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1066.msg10722#msg10722"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1066.msg10722#msg10722">Re: What class will you play in EQ2?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #15 on:</b> September 01, 2004, 10:56:51 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							well sure granted its still in beta.&nbsp; <br /><br />for starter&#039;s&nbsp; the Gear sets, I can go city to city, and see the same class wearing the same gear loadout, I&#039;m sure they hit the ol &#039;&nbsp; randomizer button for gear, But for having so many open area&#039;s already in beta, there isnt a huge selection of good gear to go through without looking like 500 other people on the server.<br /><br /><br />I know you wont think much of this next one but: DROP FUCKING BITTORENT, Jesus christ.&nbsp; &nbsp;First they started using normal bittorrent to distribute the files beta tester&#039;s needed, Then they went to the &quot;blizzard&quot; downloader, which is essentially the same flipping thing, your still DLing and Uploading from and from differeent people at ass speeds.<br /><br />Warrior&#039;s,&nbsp; &nbsp;Not in general but the way the taunt works,&nbsp; If you dont get the upgrade to it, its essentially useless 50+<br />and now i havent played a war in a bit, so i dunno if they made improvements,&nbsp; But it just seemed to me that Using a shield on a warrior Was completely useless 60% of the time.<br /><br />PVP: Every fight iam in / watched, These fights last anywhere from 5seconds to 5 minutes,&nbsp; Some classes can just for bloody ever fighting there seleteced class 1 on 1.<br /><br /><br />prob shoulda put this in rants or something /shrug<br /><br />and i prob wont buy EQ2, &quot;spiffy&quot; grahpics never appealed to me , love of the game all ya needed (hi hi, meridian 59)<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10768"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
