								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1066.msg10768#msg10768">Re: What class will you play in EQ2?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #16 on:</b> September 02, 2004, 07:41:51 pm &#187;</span></td>
