							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><div align="center"><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=275757" target="_blank"><img src="http://members.cox.net/rtmjohnson/Inkie.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a></div><br /><div align="center"><i><span style="color: blue;">PR Officer of Fires of Time</span></i></div>
