	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11025"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=285" title="View the profile of Serepi">Serepi</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 66<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://cfusionpm.com/misc/pulltoopen.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								It&#039;s all about the tail, baby!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=285"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1066.msg11025#msg11025"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1066.msg11025#msg11025">Re: What class will you play in EQ2?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #17 on:</b> September 10, 2004, 11:59:53 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							From what I understand, you select one of four archetypes: warrior, cleric, mage or rogue and then specialize from there as you level up?&nbsp; Probably less class blurring that way, but wouldn&#039;t it also reduce to some extent hybrid choices, except to the extent you can specialize in them?&nbsp; I don&#039;t understand the system too well, as you can probably see.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Serepi Serein<br />Officer, Hegemony Guild<br />&quot;Delenda est Carthago&quot;
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11027"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=223" title="View the profile of Heloisa">Heloisa</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 134<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://members.shaw.ca/petethecanuk/Rikkuavatar1.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Crazy Canuck<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=223"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1066.msg11027#msg11027"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1066.msg11027#msg11027">Re: What class will you play in EQ2?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #18 on:</b> September 10, 2004, 12:33:40 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							In a nutshell<br /><br />(cut/pasted from <a href="http://clanwhitestorm.com/eq2info/index.htm" target="_blank">http://clanwhitestorm.com/eq2info/index.htm</a>)<br /><br /><b>Character Progression: </b> <br /><br /><b>Level 1:</b>  Choose your race, sex, and avatar.  Play instanced ship encounter.  Go to Isle of Refuge (newbie isle).  Experiment with all the archetypes.  Make level 3 as a Commoner. <br /><br /><b>Level 3:</b>  Choose base class, <b>(Figher, Mage, Priest, Scout (Artisan?) )</b> choose to go to Qeynos or Freeport (some races have no choice) <br /><br /><b>Level 7:</b>  Become a citizen of your chosen city, giving you access to all zones of that city <br /><br /><b>Level 10:</b> Choose sub-class (<b>Warrior, Brawler, Crusader </b> etc for the <b>Figher</b> base class and so forth.....)<br /><br /><b>Level 15:</b>  The beginning of city loyalty quests.  Between lvls 15 and 20, one has ONE opportunity to switch allegiances through a series of quests that are “tough”. (Note: this seems to be the only way to create a froglok shadowknight, or an ogre paladin =) )<br /><br /><b>Level 20:</b> Choose specialty class. <b>(Bezerker, Guardian</b> for the <b>Warrior</b> sub-class)  Qeynos or Freeport selection is irreversible past this level. <br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />AFK[65 Archon]<b> <a href="http://peternorth.com/php/home.php" target="_blank"><span style="color: blue;">Heloisa</span></a> </b>(Wood Elf)
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
</table>
